---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalidShorthand.css
---
# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.margin {
	margin: 1px 2px;
	margin: 1px 2px 1px;
	margin: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
	margin: 1px 2px 3px 4px;
}

.padding {
	padding: 1px 2px;
	padding: 1px 2px 1px;
	padding: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
}

.inset {
	inset: 1px 2px;
	inset: 1px 2px 1px;
	inset: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
}

.scroll-margin {
	scroll-margin: 1px 2px;
	scroll-margin: 1px 2px 1px;
	scroll-margin: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
}

.scroll-padding {
	scroll-padding: 1px 2px;
	scroll-padding: 1px 2px 1px;
	scroll-padding: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
}

.border-width {
	border-width: 1px 2px;
	border-width: 1px 2px 1px;
	border-width: 1px 2px 1px 2px;
}

.border-style {
	border-style: solid dashed;
	border-style: solid dashed solid;
	border-style: solid dashed solid dashed;
}

.border-color {
	border-color: red blue;
	border-color: red blue red;
	border-color: red blue red blue;
}

.functions-and-trivia {
	margin: calc(2px + 1px) 2px !important; /* trailing comment */
	/* leading comment */ padding: 1px 2px;
}

```

